        },
        "widget_ue_connectable": {}
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Model files\nThe loader downloads into `ComfyUI/models/breezetts2/drbaph_Breeze-TTS-2-comfyui/` when `download_if_missing` is on; only the selected weights file plus the shared configs and `audio_tokenizer/` codec are fetched.\n\n- [Breeze-TTS-2-bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/Breeze-TTS-2-comfyui/resolve/main/Breeze-TTS-2-bf16.safetensors) - bf16, official shards merged bit-exact (6.49 GiB)\n- [Breeze-TTS-2-int8-hybrid.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/Breeze-TTS-2-comfyui/resolve/main/Breeze-TTS-2-int8-hybrid.safetensors) - recommended int8 build (4.53 GiB, bf16-level speed)\n- [Breeze-TTS-2-int8-convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/Breeze-TTS-2-comfyui/resolve/main/Breeze-TTS-2-int8-convrot.safetensors) - all 462 linears quantized (4.22 GiB)\n- [Breeze-TTS-2-int8-text-encoder.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/Breeze-TTS-2-comfyui/resolve/main/Breeze-TTS-2-int8-text-encoder.safetensors) - decode path bf16 (5.84 GiB)\n- `audio_tokenizer/` - Qwen3-TTS 12 Hz codec, shared by every build\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n└── 📂 models/\n    └── 📂 breezetts2/\n        └── 📂 drbaph_Breeze-TTS-2-comfyui/\n            ├── Breeze-TTS-2-bf16.safetensors              (6.49 GiB, official shards merged bit-exact)\n            ├── Breeze-TTS-2-int8-hybrid.safetensors       (4.53 GiB, recommended int8 build)\n            ├── Breeze-TTS-2-int8-convrot.safetensors      (4.22 GiB, all 462 linears quantized)\n            ├── Breeze-TTS-2-int8-text-encoder.safetensors (5.84 GiB, decode path bf16)\n            ├── config.json\n            ├── generation_config.json\n            ├── tokenizer.json\n            ├── tokenizer_config.json\n            ├── special_tokens_map.json\n            └── 📂 audio_tokenizer/                        (Qwen3-TTS 12 Hz codec, shared)\n                ├── model.safetensors                      (0.64 GiB)\n                ├── config.json\n                ├── configuration.json\n                └── preprocessor_config.json\n```\n\n\nWeights are research / non-commercial use only [BreezeBlue license](https://huggingface.co/BreezeBlue/Breeze-TTS-2/blob/main/LICENSE)"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
